  {
   "id": "ccss-2014-reserva-4-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Resuelva la ecuación matricial \\(A\\cdot X=2\\cdot(C-D^t)\\), siendo \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1\\\\2&0\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}0&2\\\\-1&2\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(D=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\2&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
     "(1 p.) Si \\(A(0,2)\\), \\(B(2,0)\\), \\(C(4,0)\\), \\(D(6,3)\\) y \\(E(3,6)\\) son los vértices de una región factible, determine, en esa región, el valor mínimo y el valor máximo de la función \\(F(x,y)=4x-3y+8\\) e indique los puntos donde se alcanzan."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[D^t=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\-1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad2(C-D^t)=2\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0\\\\0&3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>\\(|A|=-2\\neq0\\), y como \\(A\\) está a la izquierda de \\(X\\), \\(X=A^{-1}\\cdot2(C-D^t)\\):</p>\\[A^{-1}=\\frac1{-2}\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\-2&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\frac12\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad X=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\frac12\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-2&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}0&3\\\\-2&0\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(AX=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 420 300' width='100%' style='max-width:420px' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='sans-serif'><line x1='67.3' y1='266.0' x2='67.3' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='113.5' y1='266.0' x2='113.5' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='159.6' y1='266.0' x2='159.6' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='205.8' y1='266.0' x2='205.8' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='252.0' y1='266.0' x2='252.0' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='298.2' y1='266.0' x2='298.2' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='344.4' y1='266.0' x2='344.4' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='244.6' x2='386.0' y2='244.6' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='214.8' x2='386.0' y2='214.8' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='185.1' x2='386.0' y2='185.1' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='155.4' x2='386.0' y2='155.4' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='125.6' x2='386.0' y2='125.6' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='95.9' x2='386.0' y2='95.9' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='66.1' x2='386.0' y2='66.1' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='36.4' x2='386.0' y2='36.4' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='244.6' x2='386.0' y2='244.6' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='67.3' y1='266.0' x2='67.3' y2='34.0' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.3'/><text x='113.5' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>1</text><text x='159.6' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>2</text><text x='205.8' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>3</text><text x='252.0' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>4</text><text x='298.2' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>5</text><text x='344.4' y='257.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>6</text><text x='63.3' y='217.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>1</text><text x='63.3' y='188.1' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>2</text><text x='63.3' y='158.4' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>3</text><text x='63.3' y='128.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>4</text><text x='63.3' y='98.9' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>5</text><text x='63.3' y='69.1' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>6</text><text x='63.3' y='39.4' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>7</text><text x='384.0' y='239.6' font-size='11' text-anchor='end' font-style='italic'>x</text><text x='72.3' y='44.0' font-size='11' font-style='italic'>y</text><polygon points='67.3,185.1 159.6,244.6 252.0,244.6 344.4,155.4 205.8,66.1' fill='#fcd34d' fill-opacity='0.55' stroke='none'/><line x1='34.0' y1='163.7' x2='192.9' y2='266.0' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='2'/><text x='118.5' y='209.8' font-size='10' fill='#b45309' text-anchor='start'>x+y=2</text><line x1='386.0' y1='115.2' x2='229.9' y2='266.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='302.9' y='185.6' font-size='10' fill='#2563eb' text-anchor='end'>3x−2y=12</text><line x1='386.0' y1='182.1' x2='156.0' y2='34.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'/><text x='266.0' y='103.1' font-size='10' fill='#16a34a' text-anchor='end'>x+y=9</text><line x1='34.0' y1='213.7' x2='243.3' y2='34.0' stroke='#9333ea' stroke-width='2'/><text x='143.6' y='118.8' font-size='10' fill='#9333ea' text-anchor='start'>4x−3y=−6</text><text x='205.8' y='184.1' font-size='15' fill='#92400e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>R</text><circle cx='67.3' cy='185.1' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='60.3' y='200.1' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='end' font-weight='bold'>A</text><circle cx='159.6' cy='244.6' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='152.6' y='259.6' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='end' font-weight='bold'>B</text><circle cx='252.0' cy='244.6' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='259.0' y='259.6' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>C</text><circle cx='344.4' cy='155.4' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='351.4' y='148.4' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>D</text><circle cx='205.8' cy='66.1' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='212.8' y='59.1' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>E</text></svg></div><p>La región factible es el polígono de vértices dados. La función \\(F\\) alcanza sus extremos en el recinto, en puntos de su frontera; evaluamos, por tanto, \\(F\\) en los vértices<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema fundamental de la programación lineal: si la región factible es un polígono convexo y acotado, la función objetivo alcanza su máximo y su mínimo en alguno de sus vértices.</i>:</p>\\[F(A)=F(0,2)=0-6+8=2\\]\\[F(B)=F(2,0)=8-0+8=16\\]\\[F(C)=F(4,0)=16-0+8=24\\]\\[F(D)=F(6,3)=24-9+8=23\\]\\[F(E)=F(3,6)=12-18+8=2\\]<p>El mínimo se alcanza en dos vértices consecutivos, \\(A\\) y \\(E\\), y por tanto en todos los puntos del lado \\(AE\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si la función objetivo toma el mismo valor óptimo en dos vértices consecutivos, lo toma en todo el segmento que los une: hay infinitas soluciones.</i>, que está sobre la recta \\(4x-3y=-6\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(F\\) alcanza un máximo en \\(C(4,0)\\) de valor 24 y un mínimo de valor 2 en todos los puntos del segmento de extremos \\(A(0,2)\\) y \\(E(3,6)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
